        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CLB150SBR, 1-1/2\" Diameter Wood Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Columbia Wood Door Pull is available in 4 different types of wood: cherry, mahogany, white oak, and black walnut. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\" target=\"new\">Click Here</a> to see them all. This 1-1/2 inch Diameter Wood Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The solid brass brackets are also customizable since they can come in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CLB150SBR Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLB01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262230\"><b>First Impressions CLB150SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CLB150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CLB150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CLB150036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Columbia Wood Door Pull",
                "description": "Choose your favorite type of wood for the Columbia Wood Door Pull. There are 4 to choose from cherry, mahogany, white oak, and black walnut. This 1-1/2 inch Diameter Wood Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The solid brass brackets are also customizable since they can come in a wide array of finishes.",
